Package: frogatto
Version: 1.3.1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g, libpng16-16, libglew2.2, libgl1, libx11-6, libboost-regex1.74.0-icu72, libsdl-image1.2, libsdl-mixer1.2, libsdl-ttf2.0-0, libsdl1.2debian, fonts-freefont-ttf, fonts-dejavu-core
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Homepage: http://www.frogatto.com/
Description: 2D action-adventure platformer starring a quixotic frog
 Frogatto & Friends is a classic-style action-adventure platformer with
 gorgeous pixel-art and catchy music. Run, jump, and use your tongue to
 grab, swallow and spit out enemies as projectiles while exploring the
 world, solving puzzles and battling bosses.
 .
 This package repackages the official upstream binary and data files
 from Debian's frogatto/frogatto-data packages with a custom icon and a
 window sized to fill GamerCard's 720x720 screen by default.
